# Recommended security practices

## Use Strong Passwords
- have passwords with 16 or more characters long.
- Use a combination of uuper case and lower.
- Do not use any personal related information.

## Multi-Factor Authentication
- Switch on Multi-Factor Authentication where you can.
- Use Authenticator app over SMS.

## Update Software
- Ensure that any OS and application updates installed regularly.
- Enable automatic update where available.

## Beware of Phishing Emails.
Report any suspicious emails
Only open attachments or click any links after confirming the sender.

## Secure Devices
- Make sure your devices are surely locked.
- Install legitimate anti virus and anti malware software.
- Enable firewalls.
## Back-up your data
- Regularly back-up.
- Ensure they are stored securely and test to see if they can be recovered. 
